The MIT source license applies to this repository's original user-mode SDK,
application, examples, protocol and installer source. The private kernel
implementation is not published and has separate binary evaluation terms.

This independent project addresses the device access-control use case described
by HidHide (https://github.com/nefarius/HidHide). It is not affiliated with,
endorsed by or a binary/API-compatible replacement for Nefarius or HidHide.
No HidHide implementation source is included.
